   "dur": 7.352,
   "end": 75.557,
   "section": "8-Queens \u00b7 The rules",
   "music": "calm",
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "First, the rules.",
     "start": 67.655,
     "end": 68.905
    },
    {
     "text": "A queen attacks every square in her row, her column, and both diagonals.",
     "start": 68.905,
     "end": 75.007
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "q_explicit",
   "num": "10",
   "mood": "explain",
   "start": 75.557,
   "voice": "/home/user/Video-Generation/projects/daa-3.2/voice-real/10.wav",
   "dur": 5.466,
   "end": 81.573,
   "section": null,
   "music": null,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Since two queens can never share a row,",
     "start": 75.557,
     "end": 78.137
    },
    {
     "text": "we simply put queen k in row k.",
     "start": 78.137,
     "end": 81.023
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "q_vector",
   "num": "11",
   "mood": "explain",
   "start": 81.573,
   "voice": "/home/user/Video-Generation/projects/daa-3.2/voice-real/11.wav",
   "dur": 7.449,
   "end": 89.572,
   "section": null,
   "music": null,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "So the whole answer is just a list x,",
     "start": 81.573,
     "end": 84.403
    },
    {
     "text": "where x of k is the column of the queen in row k.",
     "start": 84.403,
     "end": 89.022
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "q_implicit",
   "num": "12",
   "mood": "emphatic",
   "start": 89.572,
   "voice": "/home/user/Video-Generation/projects/daa-3.2/voice-real/12.wav",
   "dur": 8.792,
   "end": 98.914,
   "section": null,
   "music": null,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Now the real test.",
     "start": 89.572,
     "end": 90.782
    },
    {
     "text": "A new queen is safe only if no earlier queen is in the same column, or on the same diagonal.",
     "start": 90.782,
     "end": 98.364
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "q_diag",
   "num": "13",
   "mood": "explain",
   "start": 98.914,
   "voice": "/home/user/Video-Generation/projects/daa-3.2/voice-real/13.wav",
   "dur": 7.062,
   "end": 106.526,
   "section": null,
   "music": null,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Two queens share a diagonal when the difference of their columns",
     "start": 98.914,
     "end": 103.433
    },
    {
     "text": "equals the difference of their rows.",
     "start": 103.433,
     "end": 105.976
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "key": "q_place",
   "num": "14",
   "mood": "explain",
   "start": 106.526,
   "voice": "/home/user/Video-Generation/projects/daa-3.2/voice-real/14.wav",
   "dur": 11.22,
   "end": 118.295,
   "section": null,
   "music": null,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "This check is the function Place of k and i.",
     "start": 106.526,
     "end": 110.986
    },
    {
     "text": "It returns true only if queen k can safely go in column i.",
     "start": 110.986,
     "end": 117.746
    }
   ]
  },
  {
